  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Water Security Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the resilience of poor people to climate change through secure and sustainable access to water resources.  We will work with the Global Water Partnership, World Bank Water Partnership Programme and GIZ International Water Stewardship Programme to support increased investment in the information, institutions and infrastructure required to deliver water security.</narrative>
  </description>
